  "rendered": "authority: none\ncloses_work: false\nreleases_action: false\nauthenticates_actor: false\nworkbook-review-id: w255130e046c133ae\nmode: preliminary\ncustody: missing\ntask_association: not-established\nThis record is not approval, filing, or release.\n\n### Judgment\noperation: continue\ndisposition: correction-required\nfinding: The combined candidate has a reproducible local entry and requires dispatcher pin enforcement before acceptance.\n\n### Reasons\n- 949 frozen inputs, 12 artifacts, 8 lab-index files and the candidate descriptor, 6 local files and 13 dependency pins verify. Prime independently appended a comment to the declared loop door on a disposable copy. Prepare still exited 0 and Python audit output showed the changed door executing. This is a runtime pin gap. The copied candidate still relies on pinned canonical predecessors, as documented by the builder.\n\n### Findings\nnone supplied\n\n### Director text\nnone measured\n\n### Answers\nnone supplied\n\n### Next action\nPin each door before loading it and prove refusal on the actual disposable entry. Reconcile the independent suite results before accepting R or W.\nThis line is not a release.\n\ntests_passed: false\nprime_review_effective: attention\neligible_for_custody_completion: false\n",
